      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNION (4) is building towards his Maiden success after showing early speed at his two runs back. Comes out of a decent rating contest with a tough on speed second over 1100m at Hawkesbury. Has his share of ability and the visors go on. Expected to go close. THE WILDLING (8) found the 900m short of her best first up with a plugging fourth over 900m at Newcastle. Strips fitter and can feature from the good draw. ALABAMA SHOWDOWN (1) resumes after making progress in his two career starts. Looks ready to go after the two trials and the booking of Sam Clipperton is a good guide to his chances. DEFINITION (2) showed good early speed on debut before he folded up in the straight to run last over 1000m at Kembla Grange. Pulled up with a slow recovery rate on that occasion and since fitted with a 900m trial placing. Respect.",
